[Music]  in north texas this morning a small town  police officer is charged with murder in  the killing of a black man jonathan  price was shot dead  reportedly while trying to break up a  fight saturday night  his family's attorney says he was  unarmed at the time maria viral spoke  with price's family  before the charges against the officer  were announced  wolf city police officer sean lucas was  booked monday night charged with murder  and his bond set at one million dollars  the texas rangers say lucas was  responding to a disturbance call outside  a gas station on saturday  that's when officer lucas encountered  price who the texas rangers say  resisted arrest in a non-threatening  posture  and walked away officer lucas according  to the rangers then  tased price before shooting and killing  him  this video captured the chaos saturday  night  the circumstances surrounding lucas's  decision to use deadly force is now  under investigation  according to family members it was price  who intervened and de-escalated a fight  between a couple  his father junior price says he showed  up to the scene on saturday as  paramedics worked to save him  what do you remember of that moment  watching my son die i knew he was dead  before he moved  hundreds gathered to peacefully honor  price monday night marching the streets  of wolf city about 70 miles outside  dallas price's sister april lewis says  he worked for the city  he was also described as a hometown hero  and a stand-up guy  he had a bright future he was going to  start up his own business fitness center  and it's just it's gone  i mean didn't have to end like that  civil rights attorney lee merritt  represents the price family  they deserve to know every detail about  what happened they need to know it  immediately  still his big sister april is skeptical  they'll get answers  i just want some kind of closure that's  all i want  the family attorney tells us there is  surveillance video of the shooting and  they are working with the texas rangers  to see that very soon  and they are also planning to file a  lawsuit in this case  tony maria thank you very much part of  what stands out in this case in addition  to the fact that the officer was charged  and charged so quickly quickly  is uh price was childhood friends with  will middlebrooks who was a former  infielder for the red sox uh  and middlebrooks has gone online and  taken to defend his friend and say  he wasn't a criminal he wasn't resisting  arrest this is racism  pure and simple and we've got to look at  it as such i like how he says no excuses  this time  he was a criminal nope not this time he  resisted arrest  just to comply and just to comply with  cops nope that doesn't work either  this was purely an act of racism we  should say  and mr middlebrooks is white he said i'm  sick i'm heartbroken and i'm furious  and he's telling other white people who  are coming at him online to take a step  back this time  how many times though guys do we have to  keep telling this story  and nothing seems to change well  hopefully we'll get the surveillance  footage  that they believe is out there and we'll  see it  yeah let's try to do the right thing all  right marie thank you very much

